Subject: rename system/main.c::main to yetty_qemu_main

The iOS/tvOS UIKit harness in system/tvos-main.m owns the real main() and
calls into qemu's entry point on a worker thread. Rename qemu's main so
both can live in the same binary without a multiple-definition error.

--- a/system/main.c
+++ b/system/main.c
@@ -66,7 +66,7 @@
 int (*qemu_main)(void) = os_darwin_cfrunloop_main;
 #endif

-int main(int argc, char **argv)
+int yetty_qemu_main(int argc, char **argv)
 {
     qemu_init(argc, argv);

